' and addresses to +20.., then its entry dialog_module_entry% is called. It only does anything when the module
' is loaded (dialog_module_loaded!); when it is not, the code runs on into the routine that follows (the RETURN
' stands inside the IF), which is harmless as the program ends without the module.
FUNCTION dial_match_system_font(match_font_id&,VAR match_font_first_out&,match_font_second_out&,match_font_third_out&,match_font_fourth_out&)
